# Forget Me Not (WotG 42) from Batallia Downs, the four Large Memory Fragments held: the Cavernous Maw plays 4 [0, 1,
# 2964, 1700, 43]; its finish sets Status 1 and Option 105, and the next tick shows the set-down at 800 71.839 770 rot
# 63 in Grauberg [S]. The login there at Status 1 plays the zone-in 33, left open; the update with option 1 sends 05C
# [12, 23, 1756]; the finish sets Status 2 and xi.maws.goToMaw sends the char to xi.maws.pastMaws[105]: the next tick
# shows Batallia Downs [S] at -51.486 0.371 436.972 rot 128. The login there at Status 2 completes the mission (Pillar
# of Hope current) and takes the four fragments (xi.wotg.helpers.removeMemoryFragments).
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/4 GraubergS/onZoneIn/1 GraubergS/onEventUpdate/33 GraubergS/onEventFinish/33 BatalliaDownsS/onZoneIn/1
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ForgetMeNot current
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment1
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment2
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment3
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment4
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                      # 4
finish                                     # Status 1, Option the zone; set down in Grauberg [S]
tick 400
login open                                 # Status 1: 33
update 33 option=1                         # the update packet
finish                                     # Status 2; goToMaw: the maw's other side
tick 400
login                                      # Status 2: completed, the fragments removed
